WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:04.970
Another thing that Dr. Bright is not allowed
to do at the SCP Foundation: Make up jodies

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:09.650
for Morning Calisthenics, including, of course,
the Mickey Mouse Club House song.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.540
In Military parlance, jodies are a name for
the chants performed while marching to keep

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.959
the soldiers in time and boost morale.

00:00:15.959 --> 00:00:20.200
These can be extremely helpful for military
marches, but not for the group calisthenics

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.580
being performed in the Foundation gym.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.700
Certain employees, who chose to remain anonymous
in their HR Reports, described this as “annoying”

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.860
and “distracting”, especially when Dr.
Bright chose to sing the Mickey Mouse Club

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:32.860
House song.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:38.260
Dr. Clef, who did not wish to remain anonymous,
said, “If I have to hear that stupid song

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:42.370
one more time when I’m trying to get my
morning reps in, I’m shoving that goofy

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:46.530
medallion where the sun don’t shine.”

